TITLE 1D transport 10 cells, 10 shifts, exchange
SOLUTION 0  Infilling
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0
SOLUTION 1-10 Initial
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.csv
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -head Step Cell SpCond_uScm
    10 PUNCH STEP_NO, CELL_NO, SC
TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -time_step 1
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions constant constant
    -lengths 1
    -dispersivities 0
    -correct_disp true
    -diffusion_coefficient 0
    -punch_cells 1
    -punch_frequency 1
END
